 "intro_zh": "天台山以佛教天台宗祖庭、道教南宗祖庭所在地和济公“活佛”的故乡而闻名于世。景区气候温和、历史悠久，自然景观和人文景观相互渗透，山、岩、洞、瀑各具神韵，形成了古、幽、清、奇的独特风格。",
 "intro_en": "Tiantai Mountain (also Tí Taî in the local language) is a mountain in Tiantai County, Taizhou, Zhejiang Province, China. Its highest peak, Huading, reaches a height of 1,138 meters (3,734 ft). It was designated a scenic area in 1985, with an area of 105 km2. One of nine remaining wild populations of Seven-Son Flower (Heptacodium miconioides) is located on mount Tiantai.",
 "intro_en_source": "wikipedia",
